# Offline CP2K multi-k PBE-D4 two-body ENERGY_FORCE pin (gpw-d4-kpoint-forces)

## Binary

| Item | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Engine | CP2K 2026.1 `cp2k.psmp` git:5e54ba2 |
| Flags | `omp libint fftw3 libxc elpa parallel scalapack mpi_f08 spglib libdftd4` |
| Build | private Arrhenius rebuild with `-DCP2K_USE_DFTD4=ON` |
| Prefix | `/nobackup/proj/disk/teoroo/personal/jicli594/work/cp2k-dftd4/install` |
| libdftd4 | EasyBuild `dftd4/3.7.0-gfbf-2025b` (+ mctc-lib, multicharge, mstore) |
| Data | `CP2K_DATA_DIR=/nobackup/.../cp2k/src/data` |

Stock source install (`…/cp2k/install`, no `libdftd4` in `cp2kflags`) aborts
`TYPE DFTD4` — do **not** use it for this twin.

## Reproduce (offline only — never ctest)

```bash
bash -lc '
module load buildenv-gcc/2026.03-mpich
export PATH=/nobackup/proj/disk/teoroo/personal/jicli594/work/cp2k-dftd4/install/bin:$PATH
export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/nobackup/proj/disk/teoroo/personal/jicli594/work/cp2k-dftd4/install/lib64:\
/software/sse2/el9_epyc9005/easybuild/prefix/software/dftd4/3.7.0-gfbf-2025b/lib64:\
/software/sse2/el9_epyc9005/easybuild/prefix/software/mctc-lib/0.5.1-GCC-14.3.0/lib:\
/software/sse2/el9_epyc9005/easybuild/prefix/software/multicharge/0.3.1-gfbf-2025b/lib:\
$LIBRARY_PATH:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}
export CP2K_DATA_DIR=/nobackup/proj/disk/teoroo/personal/jicli594/work/cp2k/src/data
export OMP_NUM_THREADS=8
cd /tmp && mkdir -p atv-cp2k-d4-kpt-forces && cd atv-cp2k-d4-kpt-forces
ln -sf $CP2K_DATA_DIR/{BASIS_MOLOPT,GTH_POTENTIALS} .
# copy both .inp from tools/cp2k_oracle/inputs/gpw-d4-kpoint-forces/
mpirun -np 1 cp2k.psmp -i water_dimer_d4_kpoint_forces.inp \
       -o water_dimer_d4_kpoint_forces.out
mpirun -np 1 cp2k.psmp -i water_dimer_plain_kpoint_forces.inp \
       -o water_dimer_plain_kpoint_forces.out
'
```

## D4 input requirements

- `D4_CUTOFF` (2-body) ≥ `R_CUTOFF` (3-body slot); twin uses 30 / 20 Å.
- Two-body only: `CALCULATE_C9_TERM .FALSE.` + `FACTOR_S9_TERM 0.0`.
- K-points: `DIAGONALIZATION` (not OT); `EPS_SCF 1e-8`; `MONKHORST-PACK 1 1 2`.

## Pinned numbers (2026-08-01)

```
E_disp (D4 twin)             = -0.00099470623400 Ha
E_total (D4)                 = -34.339246684320045 Ha
E_total (plain)              = -34.338251978086035 Ha
T_cp2k internal (D4 twin)    = 4.117 s   (1 MPI × 8 OMP)
```

