ΔF = F(D4) − F(plain); max |ΔF| ≈ 1.361e−4 Ha/Bohr.
Cross-check vs dftd4 3.7.0 `--mbdscale 0 --grad` (F=−g, remapped O H H O H H):
max |ΔF − F_dftd4| ≈ **4.2e−9** Ha/Bohr under these cutoffs.
